        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Seconds spent waiting per second of wall time, by reason: limiter (a token bucket was empty), retry (a throttled or failed call backed off, honouring Retry-After), hold (the provider said its allowance was low).",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
